STEP 10
GROUP back-T
  ADD axle-S 4519 lightgray
  ADD connector-T 59443 black
CONNECT axle-S.axle3 -> connector-T.axlehole?
  ADD pin-U 43093 blue
CONNECT pin-U.axle1 -> connector-T.axlehole?
END
ATTACH back-T
